#: includes/admin/class-prevent-browser-caching-admin-settings.php:172
msgid "Styles & scripts (CSS, JS)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-prevent-browser-caching-admin-settings.php:174
msgid "Visitors get the current files instead of cached ones, thanks to the \"ver\" URL parameter."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-prevent-browser-caching-admin-settings.php:178
